{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027860/extras/3ed31966e8165bd57627eeac91cf8eb6.poster.avif?t=1760002675\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027860/extras/3ed31966e8165bd57627eeac91cf8eb6.webm?t=1760002675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027860/extras/3ed31966e8165bd57627eeac91cf8eb6.mp4?t=1760002675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Wife Threw Out My Card Collection</strong> is a trash obsession simulator where every pile might hide a rare find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, you\u2019ll get to know the basic mechanics: dig, sort, collect streamer trading cards, and rescue birds from garbage heaps. A portion of items and cards is available \u2014 just enough to get a taste of the treasure hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig, sort, collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue birds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the complete card collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humor, nostalgia, and the beauty of trash</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No battles, only garbage </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027860/extras/76b6fdd540d30f407d077801a6eb96d7.poster.avif?t=1760002675\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027860/extras/76b6fdd540d30f407d077801a6eb96d7.webm?t=1760002675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027860/extras/76b6fdd540d30f407d077801a6eb96d7.mp4?t=1760002675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to expect in the full version:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More cards, items, and birds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more trash madness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New discoveries that will become collector\u2019s trophies</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027860?t=1760002675","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027860?t=1760002675","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027860/6df46e4b11bc69121d07aec6dcff8fe7f70663cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760002675","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027860/6df46e4b11bc69121d07aec6dcff8fe7f70663cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760002675","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027860/extras/3ed31966e8165bd57627eeac91cf8eb6.poster.avif?t=1760002675\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027860/extras/3ed31966e8165bd57627eeac91cf8eb6.webm?t=1760002675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027860/extras/3ed31966e8165bd57627eeac91cf8eb6.mp4?t=1760002675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Wife Threw Out My Card Collection</strong> is a trash obsession si